The Network is a group of informants and spies working under the [[People/Althane/The Broker|Broker]] to maximize information distribution to their wealthy clients. Due to their less-than-legal activities, the organization doesn't advertise, and many people go their entire lives without interacting with the group as a whole.

Members of the Network operate in small cells, and members of one cell don't know anything about the other cells. The location of the group is unknown, but they're active in most parts of the [[Geography/Althane/The Occident|Occident]].

No one in the Network knew the Broker's face; the place passes to whoever kills the one who holds it. When the Broker ascended and vanished from every record, [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] slid into the empty place, and the cells he runs still do not know who he is. [[People/Althane/Oxus|Oxus]] is the only one who knew the last Broker's face, and she keeps her ties there without working its jobs.
